{"words": [{"text": "أَمْ", "translation": "Or"}, {"text": "حَسِبْتُمْ", "translation": "(do) you think"}, {"text": "أَن", "translation": "that"}, {"text": "تَدْخُلُوا۟", "translation": "you will enter"}, {"text": "ٱلْجَنَّةَ", "translation": "Paradise"}, {"text": "وَلَمَّا", "translation": "while not"}, {"text": "يَأْتِكُم", "translation": "(has) come to you"}, {"text": "مَّثَلُ", "translation": "like (came to)"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "those who"}, {"text": "خَلَوْا۟", "translation": "passed away"}, {"text": "مِن", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "قَبْلِكُم ۖ", "translation": "before you"}, {"text": "مَّسَّتْهُمُ", "translation": "Touched them"}, {"text": "ٱلْبَأْسَآءُ", "translation": "[the] adversity"}, {"text": "وَٱلضَّرَّآءُ", "translation": "and [the] hardship"}, {"text": "وَزُلْزِلُوا۟", "translation": "and they were shaken"}, {"text": "حَتَّىٰ", "translation": "until"}, {"text": "يَقُولَ", "translation": "said"}, {"text": "ٱلرَّسُولُ", "translation": "the Messenger"}, {"text": "وَٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "and those who"}, {"text": "ءَامَنُوا۟", "translation": "believed"}, {"text": "مَعَهُۥ", "translation": "with him"}, {"text": "مَتَىٰ", "translation": "When"}, {"text": "نَصْرُ", "translation": "[will] (the) help"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ ۗ", "translation": "(of) Allah (come)"}, {"text": "أَلَآ", "translation": "Unquestionably"}, {"text": "إِنَّ", "translation": "[Indeed]"}, {"text": "نَصْرَ", "translation": "help"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ", "translation": "(of) Allah"}, {"text": "قَرِيبٌۭ", "translation": "(is) near"}], "sahih": "Or do you think that you will enter Paradise while such [trial] has not yet come to you as came to those who passed on before you? They were touched by poverty and hardship and were shaken until [even their] messenger and those who believed with him said, \"When is the help of Allāh?\" Unquestionably, the help of Allāh is near."}